      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Think of the \"residuals\" as reusable coding patterns, memory snippets, or techniques you learned while working on the project. It's like the idea that after you leave a job, you still use the strategies and shortcuts you learned to improve future work. You can adapt and apply these insights to your future projects, but you must keep the actual Confidential Information secret.",
